@host = http://localhost:5081

### Place one order
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "http-file-001",
  "customerId": "cust-001",
  "customerEmail": "john.doe@globomantics.com",
  "productSku": "SKU-A1",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Recently saved orders
GET {{host}}/orders/recent

### Customers
GET {{host}}/customers

### Look up a customer by email (PII in the query string)
GET {{host}}/customers/lookup?email=john.doe@globomantics.com

### Catalog products
GET {{host}}/catalog/products

### Current demo toggle state
GET {{host}}/demo/settings
